{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1548","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"吴丝蜀桐：指精美的箜篌，其弦用吴地所产的丝制作（吴地以产丝著称），其身干用蜀地所产的桐木制作（蜀中桐木适宜做乐器）。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"张：弹奏。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"高秋：深秋九月。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"颓：下垂、堆积的样子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"江娥啼竹：传说舜南巡，死于苍梧山（在今湖南宁远），二妃娥皇、女英得到消息，挥泪于竹，竹尽生斑。江娥，指娥皇、女英。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"素女：传说中与黄帝同时期的神女，善于弹瑟歌唱。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"中国：即国中，指在国都长安城里。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-7"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"昆山：即昆仑山，传说中著名的美玉产地。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-8"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"玉碎：美玉碎裂（声音清脆悦耳）。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-9"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"泣露：指滴露。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-10"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"笑：指花盛开。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-11"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"十二门前融冷光：指笼罩整个长安城的月光变得温煦。十二门，长安城四面，每一面各有三门。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-12"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"二十三丝：指箜篌。有一种竖箜篌，有二十三弦。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-13"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"紫皇：道教传说中地位最高的神仙。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-14"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"石破天惊：女娲所补五色石为箜篌声破裂，天界为之震惊。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-15"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"神妪：指女神成夫人。据说她喜好音乐，善弹箜篌，听见有人依琴瑟咏歌就翩翩起舞。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-16"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"吴质：即传说中月宫的仙人吴刚，其字为质。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-17"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"露脚斜飞湿寒兔：露滴斜斜坠落，打湿了（全神贯注聆听箜篌演奏的）玉兔。寒兔，玉兔。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-10359-18"}],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"吴丝蜀桐","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-10359-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"张","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-10359-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"高秋","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-10359-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，空山凝云颓","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-10359-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"不流。\n\n江娥啼竹","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-10359-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"素女","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-10359-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"愁，李凭中国","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-10359-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"弹箜篌。\n\n昆山","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-10359-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"玉碎","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-10359-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"凤凰叫，芙蓉泣露","type":"text"},{"label":"[10]","noteId":"footnote-10359-10","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"香兰笑","type":"text"},{"label":"[11]","noteId":"footnote-10359-11","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n十二门前融冷光","type":"text"},{"label":"[12]","noteId":"footnote-10359-12","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，二十三丝","type":"text"},{"label":"[13]","noteId":"footnote-10359-13","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"动紫皇","type":"text"},{"label":"[14]","noteId":"footnote-10359-14","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n女娲炼石补天处，石破天惊","type":"text"},{"label":"[15]","noteId":"footnote-10359-15","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"逗秋雨。\n\n梦入神山教神妪","type":"text"},{"label":"[16]","noteId":"footnote-10359-16","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，老鱼跳波瘦蛟舞。\n\n吴质","type":"text"},{"label":"[17]","noteId":"footnote-10359-17","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"不眠倚桂树，露脚斜飞湿寒兔","type":"text"},{"label":"[18]","noteId":"footnote-10359-18","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"blocks":[{"items":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"供奉朝廷的梨园弟子李凭善于弹奏箜篌，蜚声朝野。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"此诗描摹李凭九月暮秋的箜篌演奏，","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"以凤鸣玉碎、芙蓉泣露、香兰欢笑形容箜篌的声音，","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"以行云为之静止、江娥为之啼哭、神女为之悲愁、月亮寒光因之融化、紫皇为之感动、石为之破、天为之惊、雨为之降、老鱼为之跳跃、瘦蛟为之起舞、吴刚为之不眠等众多神话意象，来表现李凭弹箜篌的超凡技艺与神奇魅力。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"诗人以惊人的想象贯串神仙世界和人间世界，","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"并把视觉、听觉、触觉等多种感官体验熔铸于一炉，","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"营造出一种神出鬼没、石破天惊的独特意境。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"诵读此诗，想一想它为何被称为“摹写声音至文”（方扶南《李长吉诗集批注》）。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"ordered":false,"type":"list"}],"type":"quote"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《李贺诗歌集注》卷一（上海人民出版社1977 年版）。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"此诗大约作于元和六年（811） 至八年（813）间，作者当时在京城长安任奉礼郎。李凭，当时供奉宫廷的梨园弟子，以善于弹奏箜篌著称。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"箜篌引，乐府旧题。箜篌，古代的一种弦器，二十三弦或二十五弦，分卧式、竖式两种。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e6%9d%8e%e5%87%ad%e7%ae%9c%e7%af%8c%e5%bc%95-%e6%9d%8e%e8%b4%ba","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e6%9d%8e%e5%87%ad%e7%ae%9c%e7%af%8c%e5%bc%95-%e6%9d%8e%e8%b4%ba","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e5%8f%a4%e8%af%97%e8%af%8d%e8%af%b5%e8%af%bb/%e6%9d%8e%e5%87%ad%e7%ae%9c%e7%af%8c%e5%bc%95-%e6%9d%8e%e8%b4%ba","title":null}],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10359,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-1","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-2","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-3","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-3","text":"[3]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-4","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-4","text":"[4]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-5","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-5","text":"[5]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-6","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-6","text":"[6]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-7","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-7","text":"[7]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-8","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-8","text":"[8]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-9","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-9","text":"[9]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-10","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-10","text":"[10]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-11","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-11","text":"[11]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-12","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-12","text":"[12]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-13","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-13","text":"[13]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-14","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-14","text":"[14]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-15","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-15","text":"[15]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-16","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-16","text":"[16]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-17","postId":10359,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-10359-17","text":"[17]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https: